---
// Services.astro — Client outcome framing for international SMB audience
---

<section id="services" class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 border-b-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#F9F9F7]">
  <!-- Section Header -->
  <div class="mb-12 border-b-2 border-[#111111] pb-4">
    <div class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-600 font-bold mb-2">Services // How We Help Your Business Grow</div>
    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase text-[#111111] tracking-tight">WHAT WE DO</h2>
  </div>

  <!-- Column Grid: 3-cols with Collapsed Borders -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 border border-[#111111] bg-white">
    <!-- Service 1: Websites -->
    <div class="p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-[#111111] flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-colors duration-200 group">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-[#CC0000] font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">01 / Web Development</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-[#111111] mb-4 leading-tight">WEBSITES THAT RANK & CONVERT</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 text-justify mb-4">
          Custom-built websites engineered for Google page 1. No templates, no page builders — just precision-crafted code that loads in under one second. Every site ships with perfect Lighthouse scores, mobile-first design, and SEO baked in from day one.
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-6">
          Ideal for: Local businesses, e-commerce, service companies, startups
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#111111] pt-4 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-600">
          <span class="font-bold text-neutral-900 block mb-1">BUILT WITH</span>
          React, Astro, Next.js, Laravel, Tailwind, TypeScript
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 2: AI -->
    <div class="p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-[#111111] flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-colors duration-200 group">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-[#CC0000] font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">02 / AI Automation</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-[#111111] mb-4 leading-tight">AI CHATBOTS THAT WORK FOR YOU</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 text-justify mb-4">
          Intelligent customer service agents that handle bookings, answer questions, and reduce your support costs by up to 35%. Deployed on your website, WhatsApp, or Telegram — they work 24/7 so your team doesn't have to.
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-6">
          Ideal for: Hotels, restaurants, clinics, e-commerce stores
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#111111] pt-4 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-600">
          <span class="font-bold text-neutral-900 block mb-1">BUILT WITH</span>
          Python, LLM APIs, RAG, Vector DBs, Telegram & WhatsApp APIs
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 3: Custom Tools -->
    <div class="p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-colors duration-200 group">
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-[#CC0000] font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">03 / Custom Tools</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-[#111111] mb-4 leading-tight">CUSTOM TOOLS & DASHBOARDS</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-neutral-600 text-justify mb-4">
          Internal tools, reporting dashboards, and monitoring systems built exactly to your specifications. Stop paying for expensive SaaS products you barely use — get a tool that does exactly what you need, nothing more.
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-6">
          Ideal for: Operations teams, traders, healthcare, education
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#111111] pt-4 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-600">
          <span class="font-bold text-neutral-900 block mb-1">BUILT WITH</span>
          Python, Node.js, PostgreSQL, Charting Libraries, Desktop APIs
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Ornamental Divider -->
  <div class="py-8 text-center font-serif text-2xl text-neutral-400 tracking-[1em] select-none">
    ✦ ✦ ✦
  </div>
</section>
